{"source":"BMKG — Peringatan Dini Cuaca (nowcast)","feed":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/rss.xml","checkedAt":"2026-10-14T05:17:33.632Z","alerts":[{"id":"2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.10.14.05.71.001","link":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CSR20261014001_alert.xml","event":"Hujan Lebat dan Petir","headline":"Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Sulawesi Utara","description":"Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 14 October 2026, 13:00 WITA di sebagian wilayah Sulawesi Utara, khususnya di TUMPAAN.\n Kondisi ini berpotensi menimbulkan dampak berupa jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal.\n Masyarakat dihimbau untuk tetap waspada, mengurangi aktivitas di luar ruangan, serta mengambil langkah-langkah pencegahan yang diperlukan guna menjaga keselamatan.\n Kondisi diperkirakan dapat berlangsung hingga 14 October 2026, 15:30 WITA.","impact":"jarak pandang berkurang, angin kencang, dan banjir lokal","severity":"Moderate","urgency":"Immediate","certainty":"Observed","sent":1791953760000,"effective":1791954000000,"expires":1791963000000,"infographic":"https://nowcasting.bmkg.go.id/infografis/CSR/2026/10/14/infografis.jpg","province":"Sulawesi Utara","districts":{"primary":["TUMPAAN"],"extended":[]},"polygons":[[[1.33,124.705],[1.327,124.709],[1.327,124.712],[1.325,124.718],[1.318,124.722],[1.301,124.725],[1.29,124.703],[1.289,124.685],[1.278,124.662],[1.269,124.652],[1.255,124.645],[1.24,124.642],[1.234,124.638],[1.23,124.629],[1.23,124.609],[1.252,124.612],[1.262,124.594],[1.265,124.595],[1.264,124.599],[1.278,124.609],[1.279,124.63],[1.336,124.625],[1.338,124.651],[1.33,124.705]]],"hasCap":true},{"id":"2.49.0.1.360.0.2026.10.14.05.11.002","link":"https://www.bmkg.go.id/alerts/nowcast/id/CAH20261014002_alert.xml","event":"Hujan Lebat dan Petir","headline":"Hujan Lebat disertai Petir di Aceh","description":"Hujan lebat disertai petir akan terjadi pada 14 October 2026, 10:33 WIB di sebagian wilayah Aceh, khususnya di BIREM BAYEUN, IDI RAYEUK, IDI T